# Changelog fragments directory

This directory contains towncrier news fragments. Each PR should add its own
fragment file named for the card or PR (e.g., `c75f1c98.added.md` or `pr126.fixed.md`).

Fragment types:
- added.md    - New features
- changed.md  - Changes to existing functionality
- deprecated.md - Soon-to-be removed features
- removed.md  - Removed features
- fixed.md    - Bug fixes
- security.md - Security fixes
- docs.md     - Documentation changes

When a release is made, run `towncrier build --version <version>` to compile
all fragments into CHANGELOG.md and remove them from this directory.

Example fragment (added.md):
```
Added provider-neutral read-only dashboard assistant through SKGateway with
typed request/response validation and fail-closed error handling.
[PR #130](https://github.com/smilinTux/skdashboard/pull/130)
```
